<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('partials/head', { metaDescription: 'TrioCraft transforms offices, events, apparel, and vehicles into immersive brand experiences — backed by a vetted production network and a live Production Marketplace.' }) %></head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/site-header') %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">⬡ Nairobi, Kenya · <%= providerCount %>+ Vetted Production Partners</div>
    <h1>Transforming physical spaces into <em>immersive brand experiences.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">From a reception wall to a full exhibition stand, TrioCraft manages the complete branding lifecycle — strategy, design, production, and quality assurance — through one accountable team and a curated production network.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/work">See Our Work</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/marketplace/custom-brief">Start a Project →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><b><%= providerCount %>+</b><span>Vetted Production Partners</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>11</b><span>Service Categories</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>100%</b><span>Pantone-Matched Quality Checks</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sector-row">
      <span class="sector-pill">Government</span>
      <span class="sector-pill">NGOs</span>
      <span class="sector-pill">Corporates</span>
      <span class="sector-pill">Political Campaigns</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-bottom:0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-hd">
      <div class="eyebrow">Apparel &amp; Wearable Branding</div>
      <h2>Branded merchandise, produced at scale</h2>
      <p>Polos, hoodies, and full apparel drops — embroidered or screen-printed to spec, with quality checks before anything ships.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:stretch">
      <img src="/static/img/site/apparel-new-collection.jpg" alt="TrioCraft branded apparel collection" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--r-lg);box-shadow:var(--sh-md)">
      <img src="/static/img/site/apparel-lineup.jpg" alt="TrioCraft branded t-shirts" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--r-lg);box-shadow:var(--sh-md)">
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:24px">
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/marketplace?category=apparel-wearable-branding">Shop Apparel &amp; Wearable Branding →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-hd">
      <div class="eyebrow">Recent Work</div>
      <h2>Real spaces, real installations</h2>
      <p>A sample of what "immersive brand experience" looks like once it's built.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project-strip">
      <% featuredProjects.forEach(p => { %>
        <a class="project-card" href="/work">
          <div class="thumb"><% if (p.image) { %><img src="<%= p.image %>" alt="<%= p.title %>"><% } else { %><%= p.icon %><% } %></div>
          <div class="body">
            <div class="loc"><%= p.location %></div>
            <h4><%= p.title %></h4>
            <p><%= p.description %></p>
          </div>
        </a>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:24px">
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/work">View All Work →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--white);border-top:0.5px solid var(--border-md);border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border-md)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-hd">
      <div class="eyebrow">What We Transform</div>
      <h2>One platform. Every branding need.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <% categories.slice(0,6).forEach(c => { %>
        <a class="svc-card" href="/marketplace?category=<%= c.slug %>">
          <div class="ico"><%= c.icon %></div>
          <h3><%= c.name %></h3>
          <p><%= c.description %></p>
        </a>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:28px">
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/services">View All Services →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-hd">
      <div class="eyebrow">How It Works</div>
      <h2>From brand idea to finished installation</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><h4>Build Your Brand Vault</h4><p>Upload your logo, colours, and guidelines once — every order pulls from the same approved assets.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><h4>Pick from the Catalogue</h4><p>Apparel, packaging, signage, promotional merchandise, and more — all vetted and Pantone-matched.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><h4>Approve Your Mockup</h4><p>See a live rendered mockup before anything goes into production.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num">4</div><h4>Track to Delivery</h4><p>Real-time order tracking from quotation through quality check and delivery.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--white);border-top:0.5px solid var(--border-md);border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border-md)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-hd">
      <div class="eyebrow">Trusted By</div>
      <h2>What clients say after delivery</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-bar">
      <% testimonials.forEach(t => { %>
        <div class="testimonial">
          <p class="quote">"<%= t.quote %>"</p>
          <div class="who"><b><%= t.name %></b> · <%= t.role %></div>
        </div>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-hd">
      <div class="eyebrow">Resources</div>
      <h2>Guides for getting started</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="blog-grid">
      <% posts.forEach(p => { %>
        <a class="blog-card" href="/resources/<%= p.slug %>">
          <div class="thumb">▢</div>
          <div class="body">
            <span class="tag"><%= p.eyebrow %></span>
            <h4><%= p.title %></h4>
            <p><%= p.excerpt %></p>
            <div class="meta"><%= new Date(p.published_at).toLocaleDateString('en-KE', { year:'numeric', month:'long', day:'numeric' }) %> · <%= p.read_minutes %> min read</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <h3>Crafting Dreams, Forged in Brotherhood.</h3>
      <p>Ready to brand something properly? Browse the catalogue or send us a brief — no account required to get a quote.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/marketplace">Browse the Marketplace</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);color:#fff" href="/marketplace/custom-brief">Submit a Custom Brief</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/site-footer') %>
<%- include('partials/whatsapp-float') %>
</body>
</html>
